.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH update 1  "update " 
.SH NAME
update \- Check whether a newer `ForgeHub` is available (never downloads or replaces anything)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBupdate\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check whether a newer `ForgeHub` is available (never downloads or replaces anything)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH CLOUD
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Only check; there is no self\-update mode
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg update \-\-check
